    "sub_name": "管理個案研討與分析(二)",
    "sub_ename": "MANAGEMENT CASE STUDIES AND ANALYSIS (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在透過作業、財務與資訊管理實務個案，訓練同學獨立跨領域分析能力、溝通能力，更企圖藉由參與跨校個案競賽培養團隊合作能力，更進一步將個案所學與企業管理實務進行結合。",
    "describe_eh": "The aim of this course is to train students’ independent thinking ability, develop communication skills through various management case studies, including operation, financial, information, etc.. Also, by attending case analysis competitions, group cooperation skills will be taught. Furthermore, students can apply management theories and tools in the future practical business environment.",
